## Add or remove a domain

```bash
gmk make:service --name user
gmk remove:service --name user          # within 1 minute
gmk remove:service --name user --force  # after that
```

REST services register CRUD under `/api/v1/<names>` (pluralized from the service name). gRPC services add a proto + server stub registered at `// gmk:register-services`.

## Layout

- `cmd/main.go` — process entry
- `internal/bootstrap` — wiring, shutdown, optional infra
- `internal/service/container.go` — service container
{{- if eq .ProjectType "grpc" }}
- `api/proto` — protobuf sources
- `internal/server/grpc` — gRPC server and interceptors
{{- else }}
- `internal/api/router.go` — HTTP routes
- `internal/handler`, `internal/repository`, `internal/model`, `internal/dto`
{{- end }}
- `.gmkrc.json` — saved generate options (used by later `gmk` commands)
- `.env` — local config (gitignored)

## Environment notes

| Key | Role |
|-----|------|
| `PORT` / `HOST` | Listen address (Compose sets `HOST=0.0.0.0`) |
{{- if or .HasMySQL .HasPostgres }}
| `DB_PORT` | Engine port on the Docker network |
| `DB_PORT_FORWARD` | Host publish port if 3306/5432 is already taken |
{{- end }}
{{- if .HasAuth }}
| `API_KEY` / `AUTH_HEADER` | API key guard (`x-api-key` by default) |
{{- end }}
| `ENABLE_*` | Records selected features (compile-time wiring; see kit feature docs) |
| `FORCE_MIGRATE` | `yes` drops tables before AutoMigrate when `APP_ENV` is not `dev` or `prod` |

